<header class="page-hero">
  <h1>skyBlip Go, subject by subject.</h1>
  <p class="page-hero-subtitle">
    Seven guides, with the screens as the firmware draws them.
  </p>
</header>

<section class="band band--tint">
  <h2 class="section-title">In flight</h2>
  <div class="guide-cards">
    <article>
      <%= screen_image_tag "far-all.png", alt: "The radar page in PLOT ALL, traffic inside the ring and on the band around it" %>
      <h3><%= link_to_page "radar" %></h3>
      <p>Track up, a minute of track ahead of each aircraft, the alarm that says where to look, and the list of who is there.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <%= screen_image_tag "sixpack.png", alt: "The six-dial page" %>
      <h3><%= link_to_page "instruments" %></h3>
      <p>The GPS and barometer readings on six dials, for fun, the battery above the middle one, and on the Go+ a g-meter that keeps the peaks of the flight.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <%= screen_image_tag "astern-all.png", alt: "The radar page in PLOT ALL and a group of aircraft behind" %>
      <h3><%= link_to_page "displays" %></h3>
      <p>Every page, every menu and every prompt, and the radar drawn both ways.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <h2 class="section-title">On the ground</h2>
  <div class="guide-cards">
    <article>
      <%= screen_image_tag "menu-radar.png", alt: "The settings menu" %>
      <h3><%= link_to_page "controls" %></h3>
      <p>Two contacts, the settings under the radar, the callsign typed on the device, and the diagnostic pages.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <%= screen_image_tag "off-flat-battery.png", alt: "The screen of a device switched off on an empty battery" %>
      <h3><%= link_to_page "power" %></h3>
      <p>What it waits for on the apron, what it looks like when off, and a battery that warns as it drains.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <%= screen_image_tag "confirm.png", alt: "The authorisation prompt on the screen" %>
      <h3><%= link_to_page "phone" %></h3>
      <p>Three apps with no pairing, every change asked on the screen, and firmware from the browser.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--tint">
  <h2 class="section-title">For the curious</h2>
  <div class="resource-cards">
    <article>
      <h3><%= link_to_page "radio" %></h3>
